max_llm_rpm.description:
Optional per-key inference rate ceilings (ADR-0040) — how much of the
organization's own rate this key may use. Absent = no key-level ceiling;
the org's ceiling and the platform policy still apply.

sts_role_arn.description:
ARN of the per-Harbor STS IAM role registered in RGW. The console
uses this to call `AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity` on behalf of users;
surfacing it makes "is STS ready?" trivially diagnosable from the UI.

log_output.description:
Raw log lines the runner reported, newest last. The pod's full output
lives in the log store and is read through the run's `/logs` route;
this is the summary the runner chose to persist.

MessageRole.description:
Role of a normalized chat message. Opencode emits `user` / `assistant`;
anything else (system, tool) is collapsed to `assistant` for the MVP
rendering, which only distinguishes the two bubbles.

answers.description:
User answers in the order of the request's questions. Each answer is
the list of selected option labels (or one custom free-text answer);
a single-select question sends a one-element list.
